@startuml I-平台账户系统
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · I 平台账户系统（UC-SUB-I-01 ~ I-05）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · I 平台账户系统
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "从业人员" as WORKER
actor "供应商" as SUPPLIER
actor "采购方" as BUYER
actor "平台运营方" as OPER

rectangle "I 平台账户系统" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-I-01 注册实名账户并记账" as I01
  usecase "UC-SUB-I-02 互评劳务信用" as I02
  usecase "UC-SUB-I-03 代付工资并保障到账" as I03
  usecase "UC-SUB-I-04 分账结算商品购买" as I04
  usecase "UC-SUB-I-05 结算零工劳务" as I05
}

MERCHANT --> I01
MERCHANT --> I02
MERCHANT --> I03
MERCHANT --> I05
WORKER --> I01
WORKER --> I02
WORKER --> I03
WORKER --> I05
SUPPLIER --> I01
SUPPLIER --> I04
BUYER --> I01
BUYER --> I04
OPER --> I01
OPER --> I04

note bottom of I01
  通用基础设施·全角色共用（31 §2.6）；钱包=纯记账簿
end note
note bottom of I03
  持牌机构代付、平台不碰钱；取代原 C1 专户托管口径
end note
@enduml
